    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n**To see current offers or place your own offer on this property, please visit SherryFitz.ie and register for your mySherryFitz account** \n\nSherry FitzGerald Carroll are delighted to present No. 8 Castle Road, a well-positioned, three-bedroom, red brick, terraced residence situated in one of Dundalk's most convenient and established residential locations. Dating back to the 1890s, this property is bursting with period character—featuring its original entrance door with decorative surround, stone lintels and cills, and classic wrought-iron railings and gate to the front. \n\nThe residence offers a perfect blend of comfort and generous living accommodation to include an entrance hall, sitting room, living room, kitchen/dining room and bathroom at ground floor together with three bedrooms at first floor. In addition, there is an attic room which could work as an additional living space or ancillary storage to the main house. Externally, the property benefits from rear vehicular access and an enclosed rear garden perfect for entertaining guests in the summer months! \n\nOccupying an enviable location along Castle Road, the property offers convenience and accessibility with St. Helena's Park and the popular Spirit Store venue being within walking distance from the residence. Dundalk Town Centre is situated approx. 400 metres from the residence and boasts a wide range of cafés, bars/restaurants, retail and professional services. In addition, the property is convenient to M1 Motorway Junction 18 providing easy access to both Dublin & Belfast making this an ideal home for commuters or those with hybrid working options.\n\nWhile filled with timeless charm, this home offers a generous, well-balanced layout ready for its next owners to make it their own. Must be viewed to be fully appreciated!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGROUND FLOOR - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - \n\n\nLiving Room - 3.6m x 3.6m\n\n\nFamily Room - 3.6m x 3.0m\n\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 6.1m x 4.7m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.5m x 1.7m\n\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nBedroom - 4.7m x 3.6m\n\n\nBedroom - 4.7m x 2.8m\n\n\nBedroom - 3.6m x 3.0m\n\n\nATTIC FLOOR - \n\n\nAttic - 3.6m x 3.0m\n\n\n - \nTOTAL FLOOR AREA: 1,227 sq.ft. (114 sq.m.) approx.\n\n"
